每个元组中, 频数在前, 所以列表便是按频数排序. 下面循环会输出前十个最常用单词:
t = most_common(hist)
print(''The most common words are:'')
for freq, word in t[:10]:
print(word, freq, sep=''__OPEN_BOOK_BACKSLASH__t'')
