def subtract(d1, d2):
res = dict()
for key in d1:
if key not in d2:
res[key] = None
return res
若要找到包含在书中, 但是不包含在words.txt 中的单词, 我们可以用process_file 函数
先建立一个words.txt 的词频统计, 然后再做减法:
words = process_file(''words.txt'')
diff = subtract(hist, words)
print("Words in the book that aren''t in the word list:")
for word in diff:
print(word, end='' '')
