{c1 · (2 3) + c2 · (4 6) | c1, c2 ∈R}
The second row vector is linearly dependent on the ﬁrst and so we can simplify
the above description to {c · (2 3) | c ∈R}.
3.3 Lemma If two matrices A and B are related by a row operation
A
