be of index more than one either). Its action on a string basis must be ⃗β3 7→⃗0
and since it is the zero map, its canonical form N6 is the 1×1 zero matrix.
Consequently, the canonical form J6 for the action of t on N∞(t −6) is the
1×1 Jordan block matrix with the single entry 6. For the basis we can use any
